  "prefLabel": "He-C 6344.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6344.02 Scope. This part shall apply to community-based behavioral health service providers for DCYF who receive financial reimbursement from the department of health and human services (DHHS) for services provided to children and families.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6344) #9311, eff 11-5-08, ss by #12206, eff 6-10-17",
